radio-negative-certificate-v1
# Synthetic COUNT-valid k=1 facts for block-summary minimalization regression.
# Within the equal-(np,max-product) group, the first two facts are incomparable and each
# dominates one of the final two. With test block size 2, low-mass queries reject block 2.
fact 1 Sb(6:1,2:1)
fact 1 Sb(3:2,2:2)
fact 1 Sb(6:1,6:1)
fact 1 Sb(3:2,3:2)
